#: CalendarTool.cpp:72
msgid ""
"End date is before start date! Please make sure that end date comes after "
"start date."
msgstr ""
"Li date di fén est dvant l' date di cominçmint !  Waitîz s' i vs plait kel "
"date di fén arive aprè l' cisse di cominçmint."

#: CalendarTool.cpp:72 CalendarTool.cpp:77
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Aroke"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:77
msgid ""
"Calendars should not be longer than 10 years. If you really need such long "
"periods you need to split them up."
msgstr ""
"Les calindrîs n' duvrént nén esse pus longs ki 10 anêyes. Si vs avoz vormint "
"dandjî d' on télmint long moumint, i vs fåt l' dispårti e bokets."

#: CalendarTool.cpp:82
msgid ""
"Start and end dates are equal! Only one day will be inserted, do you want to "
"continue?"
msgstr ""
"Li date di cominçmint eyet d' fén sont ewales ! I gn årè k' on seu djoû d' "
"sititchî, voloz vs continouwer ?"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:82 CalendarTool.cpp:87 CalendarTool.cpp:103
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Asteme"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:87
msgid ""
"Creating a calendar for a longer period than a year can take up a lot of "
"space, do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Ahiver on calindrî pos ont moumint pus long k' ene anêye pout prinde bråmint "
"d' plaece, voloz vs continouwer ?"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:103
msgid ""
"The area where the calendar is inserted is NOT empty, are you sure you want "
"to continue, overwriting existing data? If you choose No the area that would "
"be required for the desired calendar will be selected so you can see what "
"data would be overwritten."
msgstr ""
"Li redjon ewou çki dj' doet stitchî l' calindrî n' est NÉN vude, estoz vs "
"seur di voleur continouwer, sipotchant inla les dnêyes egzistantes ? Si vs "
"tchoezixhoz Neni, li redjon k' ons åreut dandjî pol calindrî volou srè "
"tchoezeye afisse ki vs poloxhe vey kénès dnêyes seront spotcheyes."

#: CalendarTool.cpp:114
msgid "Insert Calendar"
msgstr "Sititchî calindrî"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:119
#, kde-format
msgid "Calendar from %1 to %2"
msgstr "Calindrî di %1 a %2"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:159
msgid "week"
msgstr "samwinne"

